 "title": "The Psychology of People Who Don't Get Tattoos",
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "b00",
     "say": "Almost a third of adults now have a tattoo."
    },
    {
     "id": "b01",
     "say": "So if you don't have one, you've probably been asked, \"Why not?\""
    },
    {
     "id": "b02",
     "say": "And you might not have a great answer."
    },
    {
     "id": "b03",
     "say": "\"I just…"
    },
    {
     "id": "b04",
     "say": "never did.\""
    },
    {
     "id": "b05",
     "say": "But that \"never did\" usually isn't random."
    },
    {
     "id": "b06",
     "say": "It says something real about how your mind works."
    },
    {
     "id": "b07",
     "say": "And it's not what people assume."
    },
    {
     "id": "b08",
     "say": "Let's get into it."
    }
