   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "b31",
     "say": "Here's the second piece."
    },
    {
     "id": "b32",
     "say": "Research comparing people with and without tattoos found small but consistent differences."
    },
    {
     "id": "b33",
     "say": "People with tattoos, on average, scored higher on a \"need for uniqueness\"…"
    },
    {
     "id": "b34",
     "say": "and on seeking out new, intense experiences."
    },
    {
     "id": "b35",
     "say": "That doesn't make people without tattoos dull."
    },
    {
     "id": "b36",
     "say": "It often means their sense of who they are doesn't need to be worn on the outside."
    },
    {
     "id": "b37",
     "say": "Their identity lives in what they do, what they value, who they're loyal to."
    },
    {
     "id": "b38",
     "say": "Things nobody can see at a glance."
    },
    {
     "id": "b39",
     "say": "And for some people, it's simpler than personality."
    },
    {
     "id": "b40",
     "say": "It's a job, a family, a faith, a culture, or skin that heals badly."
    },
    {
     "id": "b41",
     "say": "Not every \"no\" is a statement."
    }
   ],
